# Internal docs — live in the private atlasdays-internal repo, not here.
# Patterns rather than names: every localization pass invented a new filename,
# and a name list only blocks the files someone remembered to add.
# (EDITORIAL_REVIEW_QUEUE.md is public build output; nothing below matches it.)
brand.md
AGENTS.md
CONVERSION_MEASUREMENT.md
EDITORIAL_CHECKLIST.md
RELEASE_WEBSITE_CHECKLIST.md
RESIDENCY_ARTICLES.md
